      "status": "CATALOG_REPORTED_UNVERIFIED",
      "value": "信号（Signal Browser Definition）：The fitted value from cross-sectional regressions of analyst earnings' forecast errors on cross-sectional rankings of 5-year sales growth, book-to-market, AOP, and analyst long term growth. See code for details. 组合规则（该页字段）：StockWeight=EW；LSQuantile=未写；PortfolioPeriod=12.0个月；StartMonth=6.0；Sign=-1.0；TestInOP=univariate reg nonstandard p-val。股票池/过滤：abs(prc) > 1。 Notes：Called PErr in OP. Very difficult to understand what OP is doing, so we report something close in spirit which produced a consistent port sort (albeit statisticallly insignficiant). See also AnalystValue.。 基线为原论文分组的多空组合（FAQ：baseline follows the original paper split；数据页写 monthly long-short following OPs）。未在该行写出的细节不补。"
